{"id":"6e475b6a12a44d89","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-readoncegraph.md","title":"Graph characterization of positive read-once functions","display":"thm-readoncegraph — Graph characterization of positive read-once functions","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-readoncegraph","aliases":["27-thm-readoncegraph"],"display":"thm-readoncegraph — Graph characterization of positive read-once functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-cooccurrence]]","[[27-df-readoncefunc]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§10.1 Theorem 10.1; §10.3 Theorem 10.6(i),(v)","source_printed_pages":"450,458,462–463","source_pdf_pages":"474,482,486–487","verification_status":"source-statement-and-recursive-construction-checked-full-equivalence-proof-not-independently-reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-readoncegraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-readoncegraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-readoncegraph — Graph characterization of positive read-once functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7f58350b3b48133a\" href=\"?note=7f58350b3b48133a\" title=\"27-df-cooccurrence\">27-df-cooccurrence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"abdabeb50455fed9\" href=\"?note=abdabeb50455fed9\" title=\"27-df-readoncefunc\">27-df-readoncefunc</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§10.1 Theorem 10.1; §10.3 Theorem 10.6(i),(v)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"450,458,462–463"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"474,482,486–487"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-recursive-construction-checked-full-equivalence-proof-not-independently-reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\">\\(f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\neq f(y))\">\\(\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\neq f(y))\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V(f),E(f),\\mathrm{Normal}_n,\\mathrm{P4Free}\">\\(V(f),E(f),\\mathrm{Normal}_n,\\mathrm{P4Free}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7f58350b3b48133a\" href=\"?note=7f58350b3b48133a\" title=\"27-df-cooccurrence\">27-df-cooccurrence</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"abdabeb50455fed9\" href=\"?note=abdabeb50455fed9\" title=\"27-df-readoncefunc\">27-df-readoncefunc</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\mathrm{P4Free}(V(f),E(f))\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Normal}_n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\mathrm{P4Free}(V(f),E(f))\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Normal}_n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §10.1 Theorem 10.1（印刷 p.450／PDF p.474）及 §10.3 Theorem 10.6(i),(v)（印刷 p.458／PDF p.482）；已核对陈述及 §10.3 的递归分解构造（印刷 pp.462–463／PDF pp.486–487），未逐行复验全套等价链。</li>\n<li>此处显式限定非恒定函数，且图载体取本质变量。原书的递归分解把不连通图的连通分量用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\vee\">\\(\\vee\\)</span> 合并，把补图的连通分量用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\wedge\">\\(\\wedge\\)</span> 合并；normality 确保图构造出的公式表示原函数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-cooccurrence","status":"resolved","id":"7f58350b3b48133a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cooccurrence]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readoncefunc","status":"resolved","id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-readoncefunc]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-cooccurrence","status":"resolved","id":"7f58350b3b48133a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V(f),E(f),\\mathrm{Normal}_n,\\mathrm{P4Free}$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]，$\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-readoncefunc","status":"resolved","id":"abdabeb50455fed9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$V(f),E(f),\\mathrm{Normal}_n,\\mathrm{P4Free}$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]，$\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists x,y\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(x)\\neq f(y))","display":false},{"tex":"V(f),E(f),\\mathrm{Normal}_n,\\mathrm{P4Free}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f\\in\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_n\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\left(\\mathrm{P4Free}(V(f),E(f))\\land f\\in\\mathrm{Normal}_n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\vee","display":false},{"tex":"\\wedge","display":false}],"bytes":1779,"backlinks":[{"id":"7f58350b3b48133a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"载体取实际出现于极小真支持的变量，避免把未参与函数的虚变量当成孤立顶点破坏 normality。非恒定正函数时该载体正好为本质变量集。常函数情形由 [[27-thm-readoncegraph]] 的显式前提排除。"},{"id":"ffb2e1b071d703fb","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb B^3\\to\\mathbb B$ 由 $f(x)=x_1x_2\\vee x_1x_3\\vee x_2x_3$、$g(x)=x_1x_2x_3$ 定义。$G(f),\\mathrm{Normal}_3$ 见 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]；$\\mathrm{PosReadOnceFunc}_3$ 见 [[27-df-readoncefunc]]。 识别判据见 [[27-thm-readoncegraph]]。"},{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-542","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-readoncegraph|thm-readoncegraph — Graph characterization of positive read-once functions]]"},{"id":"abebc662ad42f28a","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$V(g),E(g),\\mathrm{Normal}_n,\\mathrm{P4Free}$ 的定义域为 $g\\in\\mathrm{Monotone}_n$，见 [[27-thm-readoncegraph]] 的上游 [[27-df-cooccurrence]]；正性接口见 [[27-thm-readoncepositive]]。"}],"outgoing":["7f58350b3b48133a","abdabeb50455fed9"]}